{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261028/photo/bkn-20261028181247871-1028_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261028190709\"/><p>火場產生大量濃煙，消防到場撲救。</p><p>今日(28日)下午5時14分，荃灣鱟地坊一間地舖餐廳發生火警，現場產生大量白煙，並且四處擴散，令附近街道煙霧瀰漫。消防收到多個求助，立即到場開喉撲救，迅速救熄火災。火警原因有待進一步調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T11:41:49.950504+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T10:12:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T14:18:15.277223+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T11:38:22.957350+00:00","content_hash":"4e63a7a6c45b0c88d44c491623981050fb8af5ebef40d346493b058e76950e21","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T11:41:49.950504+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}